---
// packages/web/src/components/ECash.astro
---

<section class="py-24 bg-snow-50">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 text-center">
        Built for eCash.com by Paul Sztorc
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        Drivechain (BIP 300/301) has long promised purpose-built sidechains secured by proof-of-work.
        The upcoming eCash hard-fork activates Drivechains on an eCash base layer, providing a
        new specification for an e-cash system that preserves privacy and scalability. However,
        EthSide — the original EVM sidechain — was retired because standalone chain management was too
        time‑consuming.
      </p>

      <!-- Drivechain flow diagram -->
      <div class="mt-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-lg">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 720 260" class="w-full h-auto" role="img" aria-label="Drivechain flow: eCash L1 secures Snowside L2 via Blind Merged Mining">
          <!-- eCash L1 layer -->
          <rect x="20" y="40" width="260" height="180" rx="14" fill="#1a2335" stroke="#f7931a" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="150" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f7931a" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="700">eCash L1</text>
          <text x="150" y="92" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="10">Proof-of-Work (SHA-256d)</text>
          <!-- hash rate bars -->
          <g opacity="0.7">
            <rect x="50" y="170" width="18" height="34" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.9"/>
            <rect x="74" y="150" width="18" height="54" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.7"/>
            <rect x="98" y="160" width="18" height="44" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.8"/>
            <rect x="122" y="140" width="18" height="64" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.6"/>
            <rect x="146" y="155" width="18" height="49" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.75"/>
            <rect x="170" y="145" width="18" height="59" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.65"/>
            <rect x="194" y="165" width="18" height="39" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.85"/>
            <rect x="218" y="150" width="18" height="54" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.7"/>
            <rect x="242" y="160" width="18" height="44" rx="3" fill="#f7931a" opacity="0.8"/>
          </g>
          <text x="150" y="135" text-anchor="middle" fill="#cbd5e1" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="9">Miner Hashrate</text>
          <!-- BMM bid arrow -->
          <text x="150" y="200" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="8">BIP-301 Blind Merged Mining</text>

          <!-- Connecting arrows (hashrate secures L2) -->
          <g stroke="#f7931a" stroke-width="2" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow-orange)">
            <path d="M280 92 Q330 92 360 92" />
            <path d="M280 176 Q330 176 360 176" />
          </g>
          <defs>
            <marker id="arrow-orange" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="4" orient="auto">
              <path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z" fill="#f7931a"/>
            </marker>
            <marker id="arrow-blue" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="4" orient="auto">
              <path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z" fill="#38bdf8"/>
            </marker>
          </defs>

          <!-- Snowside L2 layer -->
          <rect x="360" y="40" width="340" height="180" rx="14" fill="#0a0f1a" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="530" y="70" text-anchor="middle" fill="#38bdf8" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Snowside L2 (Avalanche)</text>
          <text x="530" y="92" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="10">Snowman Consensus · EVM · ECX Gas</text>
          <!-- EVM blocks -->
          <g>
            <rect x="395" y="115" width="60" height="50" rx="6" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"/>
            <text x="425" y="145" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7dd3fc" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9">block</text>
            <rect x="465" y="115" width="60" height="50" rx="6" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"/>
            <text x="495" y="145" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7dd3fc" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9">block</text>
            <rect x="535" y="115" width="60" height="50" rx="6" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"/>
            <text x="565" y="145" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7dd3fc" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9">block</text>
            <rect x="605" y="115" width="60" height="50" rx="6" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
            <text x="635" y="145" text-anchor="middle" fill="#475569" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9">next</text>
          </g>
          <!-- peg-in / peg-out arrows -->
          <g stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#arrow-blue)">
            <path d="M280 118 Q330 118 360 118" />
            <path d="M360 144 Q330 144 280 144" />
          </g>
          <text x="320" y="110" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7dd3fc" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="8">peg-in</text>
          <text x="320" y="157" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7dd3fc" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="8">peg-out</text>
          <text x="320" y="196" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f7931a" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="8">BMM secure</text>
          <text x="530" y="195" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="9">USDC bridge · DApps · Agentic payments</text>
        </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
          eCash miners secure Snowside blocks via Blind Merged Mining — no hashrate, no Bitcoin-style merged mining required.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <a href="https://drivechain.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
          drivechain.info
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/LayerTwo-Labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
          LayerTwo Labs (GitHub)
        </a>
        <a href="https://x.com/Truthcoin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
          Paul Sztorc on X
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        Snowside fills that gap. We have coordinated with the eCash community to ensure the L1's
        configuration meets the specification. By leveraging Avalanche and operational automation, we
        give the community a chain that they can <strong class="text-snow-600">actually use</strong> –
        without babysitting.
      </p>
  </div>
</section>
